# Paths SQLFluff must not lint. Gitignore-style syntax.
#
# Drizzle writes these files; nobody edits them by hand. Style and formatting
# advice on generated output has no addressee — the only way to "fix" a finding
# there would be to hand-edit a file the next `drizzle-kit generate` overwrites,
# which is worse than the finding. Left in, they would also drown any real
# result under hundreds of formatting notes.
#
# Note that this exclusion currently covers every `.sql` file in the
# repository: there is no hand-written SQL yet. The configuration is here so
# that the first hand-written PostgreSQL file is linted from the moment it
# lands, rather than prompting a tooling discussion at that point.
src/core/db/migrations/generated/**
